{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected then approach, grab it, check properties, perform specific task; else scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = PerformSpecificTask    />\"",
    "BT": {
